problem:
Given $f(x) = x^{2} + a$ where $a \in \mathbb{R}$, and $g(x) = |x + 1| + |x - 2|$,
(Ⅰ) If $a = -4$, find the solution set of the inequality $f(x) \geqslant g(x)$;
(Ⅱ) If the solution set of $f(x) > g(x)$ is empty when $x \in [0,3]$, determine the range of $a$.

